<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output falls 8.2 pct m/m in April.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output falls 8.2 pct m/m in April.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in April fell 8.2 percent from March and was 24.0 percent higher than in June 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 3,975 flats were completed in April bringing the total for the January-April period to 17,083 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	   APRIL    MARCH     APRIL 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	-8.2    -16.9	    N/A</p>
<p> number of flats built	   3,975    4,331	   N/A</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
